WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.340
Moroha, was it?

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.540
I went to see how good he is.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.150
<i>Don't tell me you attacked him.</i>

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.190
Don't worry, I just tested him.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.860
I haven't hurt anyone.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.740
So how is Haimura Moroha?

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.770
He was a complete let-down.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:21.620
Sadly I can't nominate him for Rank S.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.260
Dammit!

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.130
I was going to test him, 
and he ended up going easy on me.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.050
I'm disappointed, too, of course.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.950
But they'll find out sooner 
or later, even if we lied.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:37.510
He defeated a Dreadnought class, 
even if it took the three of them.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.970
Three Rank As might cause a miracle.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.980
Maybe the other two besides 
Moroha are pretty good, too.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.870
I'm back.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.550
Welcome home, Moroha-san.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.100
Oh, Maya.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.890
Why? I mean, how?

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:33.210
I'm going to be your roommate 
starting today, Moroha-san.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.210
Huh?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:40.450
Just think of me as the world's 
warmest, softest, cutest body pillow.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.510
How could I?

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.470
Hurry up and go back to the principal.

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.970
This was Mari-oneechan's decision.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:48.890
S-Seriously?

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.100
Seriously.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.520
Good night.

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:00.030
This isn't illegal, is it?

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.320
Study abroad?

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:12.290
Great Britain HQ doesn't have 
enough able Dark Mages.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.020
They're more than happy to have one of the 
three that took down that Metaphysical.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.760
After graduation, 
you'll work as an executive—

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:18.420
No!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.720
I'm not going.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.840
Sit down, Shizuno.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:22.630
Nii-san!

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.890
This was decided on by the family.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.280
Hey!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.780
Morning, Shizuno.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:42.890
Morning, Moroha.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.810
Hey, hear me out, Urushibara!

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.660
This Maya kid says she's 
Nii-sama's roommate now!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.040
I hope you'll be patient with me.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:52.750
Tee-hee.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.600
Do you care to tell me what's going on?

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.800
I don't have a clue myself.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.640
<b>Curry Bun</b>

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.210
Time to eat.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:14.290
Your lunches have no flair!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.600
Look at mine!

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:18.540
Don't you know, Satsuki-oneesan?

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.690
Rice balls are delicious.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:23.990
I know that. That's not the point.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:26.950
I never pictured you eating curry buns.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.620
I heard it's popular here, 
so I thought I'd give it a try.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:33.620
It's the chef's favorite. He was 
a chef in his past life, too.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.120
Seriously?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.140
I should have had that, then.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.630
Want a bite?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.960
Thanks.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:44.470
What're you doing, Nii-sama?!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.210
It's pretty good.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.210
I don't care about how it tastes.

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.230
You have me, your sister!

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:54.470
How could you have a second-hand 
kiss with her, you cheat!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.480
Cheat?

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:02.230
Nii-san wasn't so heartless 
in our past lives.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:05.740
He used to do the "say ah" 
thing with me every day.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.460
Fine, fine.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.200
Here, say ah.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:14.200
You used to kiss me when I 
said ah with my eyes closed.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.900
We were really siblings, right?

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.210
All right, see you tomorrow.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.500
Yes, see you tomorrow.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.120
It was good, right?

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:28.800
Yeah!

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.650
The one with lots of meat.

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:31.100
The meat was so good.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.710
Let's go again sometime.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.560
I envy Ranjou-san.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:50.450
She gets to call Moroha "Nii-sama" and 
have him pamper her as much as she wants.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.720
Meanwhile, I...

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:58.410
Why do I always

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.420
end up like this?

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.090
I went to negotiate with 
the principal directly.

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:23.110
I asked if I can be your roommate, 
since I'm your actual sister.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.520
How'd it go?

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.360
I can't.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.280
Of course not.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.910
Listen, Nii-sama.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.820
I'll let you cheat on me for now.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.170
But she's not your sister.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:35.240
I won't let anyone else be your sister.

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:37.740
But you're going to let me cheat?

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:42.500
Why isn't Urushibara at school?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.000
Did she contact you, Nii-sama?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:45.830
No.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:47.880
Oh, no!

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.930
Moroha-san, Satsuki-oneesan.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:54.430
I'm really glad you decided 
to study abroad, Shizuno.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:58.770
My sister couldn't possibly 
refuse an offer from you, sir.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:05.060
Sir, Principal Shimon is 
calling to speak to the lady.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.060
To think she's asking for 
Shizuno specifically.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:08.780
What a nuisance that woman is.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.430
Shizuno, make it quick.

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:12.870
Okay.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.830
I'm here.

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:20.400
Is this Shizuno? It's me.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.670
What happened today?

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.630
<i>I caught a cold.</i>

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.690
Yeah, right.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:35.680
If you're not going to tell me the truth, 
I'm going to barge into your place.

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:41.590
I'm going to study in England.

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:45.210
<i>That's pretty sudden.</i>

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.320
It is.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:52.750
<i>If you're the one that wants 
to go, I'll support you.</i>

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:54.930
<i>But you don't, do you?</i>

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:02.590
<i>Forget what that brother of yours says.</i>

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.350
I can't.

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.420
Why?

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:21.980
I'm tied down to the Urushibaras.

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.170
<i>Listen, Shizuno.</i>

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.420
<i>There isn't</i>

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:35.490
a chain in this world for a 
person to chain down another.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:46.500
<i>Even without your memories you 
say the same things, Shu Saura.</i>

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.170
<i>I'll be okay, don't worry.</i>

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.440
Shizuno!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.440
Moroha.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.520
I intend to have Shizuno become an 
executive as soon as she graduates.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.280
That's more than I'd ever hoped for.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.020
It's going to get lonely for you, Tadanori.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.690
Don't worry about me.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:16.030
Please make good use of my sister 
for as many years as you need.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.390
Tell him to kindly leave.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.500
<i>Thanks, Moroha.</i>

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.380
Coming through.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:35.840
I told you I'd barge in if you lied.

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:40.650
You!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:42.050
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:43.850
Property damage and trespassing!

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.810
I lost control of myself.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.970
I won't ask you to forgive me.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.220
So what are you here for?

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.210
To warn you that you're so blind,

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.610
you're going to end up making a 
fool of yourself if you continue.

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.490
Oh?

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.540
Moroha, don't say it!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.000
I defeated that Metaphysical by myself.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:16.970
Are you declaring that you're a Rank S <i>now</i>?

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.930
Do you know what you're saying?

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:24.430
Once you're a Rank S, 
you won't have any freedom.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:27.810
Yeah, I know, and I'm ready.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.240
Why?

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:32.530
Why would you do that for me?

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.110
You don't get it, do you?

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.700
It's because it's for you that I can do it.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:44.200
I ought to go to hell.

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.450
You're a fool.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:50.550
We already died once before, 
and yet we got to meet again.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:53.250
Compared to that, studying abroad is nothing.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.580
I told you I remember almost nothing 
from my past lives, remember?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.720
That's why you're everything 
to me as you are now.

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:04.720
I don't want to be separated from you.

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:06.820
What about you?

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:12.690
Tell me how you really feel, Shizuno.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.560
I want to be with you.

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.000
In the past life, in this 
life, and in the next.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.400
I want to be with you forever.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.320
Then come with me.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.810
Haimura!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.870
Are you trying to run off with my sister?

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.320
Nii-sama, over here!

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.110
I'm flooring it.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:11.290
Shizuno?

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:20.360
Please, take my sister 
back from that kidnapper!

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:23.380
I'd cause a huge problem if I got 
involved in internal affairs.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:27.440
I appeal to you formally with 
the rights afforded to me

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:29.270
as an executive of the Japan Headquarters.

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.110
Stop carrying her around 
like a princess already.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:49.610
<b>The chains of hell release no dead.</b>

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.040
Bind!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.670
I'm so dizzy.

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:05.180
Dammit!

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:10.640
Wow, so that's what you look like.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:15.100
Now, give her back to me.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.110
I'll never give you Shizuno.

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:22.870
Well, if you really defeated 
the Metaphysical yourself,

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:26.100
there'll be no reason to make 
Shizuno study in the UK.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:27.110
But there's no evidence.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.120
What if I were to defeat you?

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:32.510
Are you challenging me to a duel?

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:36.120
Then as a Knight I have to oblige.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:37.880
Satsuki.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.040
I know, Nii-sama.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.320
Come, Saratiga!

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.530
Wow, that's a nice sword.

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:17.450
Mine's a pretty shabby piece.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.080
Don't be too disappointed.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.260
Taihaku!

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:46.710
Silly.

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:49.360
You're still not giving up?

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:51.990
It's over!

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:53.910
Freezing Shade.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.920
I hope you're not done yet.

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:07.800
Don't get too cocky. I'll kill you.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.350
Freeze Blade!

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:21.760
That's more like it.

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.190
What kind of trickery is all this?

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:26.980
It's nothing, really.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:33.570
It's a Kougi where I concentrate all of 
my body's Plana into one point. Kinnu.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.000
And a Kougi to condense time

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:39.830
and make my whole body invincible 
for a split second, "Gyokuto."

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:43.250
They're both variations on Konnoutsuu.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:45.510
<i>Invincible for a split second.</i>

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.170
<i>Then even if he can fend off my Step Three</i>

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.220
<i>with the Gyokuto, the fire 
that follows should burn him.</i>

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:52.220
<b>There exists purgatory in the netherworld and fields of fire in the corporeal world.</b>

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:58.680
<b>Fire discriminates not against good and evil 
as it burns and purifies with ferocious mercy.</b>

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:58.390
I can't give you your S at this rate.

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:02.890
<b>All must die and return to bone.</b>

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.630
<i>It's the Hagun Kougi.</i>

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:02.900
<i>I've seen it before.</i>

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.740
Shall we stop there?

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:22.670
Field of Dreams!

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:28.420
<i>What's this?</i>

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.610
<i>It's the same as back then.</i>

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:32.800
Yeah.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:36.300
So don't worry about everything 
else, just go for it.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:39.310
Thanks, Maya.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:42.610
Now I can finally fight 
with everything I've got.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.020
Oh?

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.560
Write!

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:48.260
<b>There exists purgatory in the netherworld and fields of fire in the corporeal world.</b>

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:52.560
<b>Fire discriminates not against good 
and evil as it burns and purifies with ferocious mercy.</b>

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.640
You never learn, do you?

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:53.610
What?

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.850
<b>All must die and return to bone.</b>

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.220
The Dark Art was a trap?

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:56.770
<b>God has forsaken humanity.</b>

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:58.990
<b>The world of the decadent is eternal. 
The trumpets must blare and bring the moment of judgment.</b>

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:03.390
Yin Yang Kurikara!

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:05.500
That's what you've been hiding!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.500
Oh, boy.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:15.260
<i>He has two dog tags?</i>

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.110
You did well.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:31.650
To think you'd made me invoke 
the Ginrei Argusten.

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:46.800
What?

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:48.500
What's going on?

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:09.230
It's useless.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:09.860
Give it up.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:12.100
I'm invincible!

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:22.270
Then don't be reborn!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.000
I'm shocked.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.420
Impressive!

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:39.120
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.800
<i>How can I defeat him?</i>

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.100
<i>I have to defeat him, or Shizuno...</i>

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.350
<i>Shizuno.</i>

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:51.140
You raze many nations and take 
tens of thousands of lives.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:55.410
But you save even more lives.

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:58.330
As I used to do.

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:05.870
Even if the whole world turned 
against you, I'll stay by your side.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:10.100
I'm your wife, after all.

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:13.710
I remember.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.470
Decree's Wait!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:20.900
Write!

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:26.000
<b>Ender of things, wolf of ice, lend me your breath. 
Freeze them to a silence deeper than death.</b>

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:30.260
<b>Even the affluent perish in this cruel world. 
The inescapable deeds of the past life declared by God.</b>

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:34.220
<b>As water runs from high to low, take away all life.</b>

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.220
<b>Show me a world standing still as though time itself had frozen.</b>

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.780
Good, that's it!

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:42.440
<b>Show me eternal, ultimate beauty indestructible, unassailable.</b>

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:43.790
There's someone other than the prince of 
Russia that can use Step Eight Dark Art?

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:44.940
<b>I reject understanding, I seek only perfection.</b>

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.700
It's not over.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.440
<b>How despicable!</b>

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:49.200
Moroha's chanting the forbidden spell.

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:52.200
<b>Life gathers, undulating, reeking, displaying the horrors of its procreation.</b>

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:55.780
<b>I will not accept it, I will not understand it.</b>

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:56.380
Are you ever going to 
stop letting me have fun?

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:57.800
<b>I long for a scenery of pure white.</b>

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.800
<b>I long for a beautiful world of death.</b>

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:01.840
Lose your humanity, Haimura Moroha!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.840
<b>I long for a world where all creatures are buried and closed off.</b>

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.640
<b>I long for everything to stop. Stop. Stop.</b>

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.410
Cocytus!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.880
You're a captured monster now!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.670
You're our seventh comrade!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.740
Edward-sama!

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:54.840
What?

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:56.610
You didn't defeat him?

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:59.610
I just froze him so he couldn't move.

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.610
I wanted you to avenge the car.

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:04.150
Avenge?

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.190
Sorry.

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:08.770
But I attacked him all that much, 
and I finally put a bit of a dent in him.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:11.120
If you know how to defeat him, tell me.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:14.140
How's your injury?

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:15.580
I'm almost done.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.390
Are you all right, Shizuno?

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:21.090
Yes, Ranjou-san protected me.

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:24.300
That's good.

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:29.170
Sorry it's so cramped, 
but make yourselves at home.

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:30.610
Thank you.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:34.520
Sup?

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.650
Don't worry, I won't do anything.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:42.840
Knight's honor. I admit you won.

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:46.310
I'll call off Shizuno's 
transfer, as promised.

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:48.160
Then why are you here?

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:51.120
There's something I wanted to ask.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:55.870
Why didn't you dodge my punch?

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:58.580
Because you didn't intend to kill me.

00:21:58.990 --> 00:22:01.280
How did you know?

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:07.170
You can tell from looking at your 
opponent's Plana, obviously.

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:13.020
No, you really can't.

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:16.840
You sure are a jack-in-the-box of a man.

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:19.500
Moroha Haimura.

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:22.590
With the rights granted 
to me as the president

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:25.340
of the Great Britain Headquarters, 
I formally nominate you for Rank S.

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:51.990
What'd he say?

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:55.690
That you're going to become central 
to the White Knight Agency someday,

00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:59.140
so I have to seduce you, 
no matter what it takes.

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:01.510
That's extreme.

00:23:01.510 --> 00:23:02.810
Oh well.

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:04.650
It'd be better than being far apart from you.

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:12.980
So you're the Witch of 
the Netherworld, right?

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:15.460
I don't know.

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:17.160
Don't play dumb now.

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:19.550
I'm not playing dumb.

00:23:19.550 --> 00:23:23.170
I just don't want to declare 
it like Ranjou-san did.

00:23:24.140 --> 00:23:28.230
I want you to remember me properly.

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:32.430
You're free.

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:36.810
There isn't a chain in this world 
for a person to chain down another.

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:41.040
I was a slave, and you freed me.

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:43.310
You have the responsibility to chain me down.

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:49.120
Please, don't let me go.

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:53.440
Not until we die, and not after we're reborn.

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:55.370
Forever.

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:57.820
That's your...

00:24:01.560 --> 00:24:06.930
You chained me down in the 
past life and in this life.

00:24:06.930 --> 00:24:08.420
That's your...

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.220
Your atonement towards me.

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:24.850
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:15.490 --> 00:24:17.810
Say, Maya, what do you think of Haimura-kun?

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:19.570
He has a pretty strong chest.

00:24:19.570 --> 00:24:20.680
How do you know?

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.970
Next time, episode 5: "We are the Summer!"

00:24:22.970 --> 00:24:25.100
I remember.
